      "_sWelcomeMessage": "<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/i0y4uh3.png\"><br><br>This section is dedicated to the&nbsp;2022 PC release of <b>Persona 5 Royal</b>&nbsp;on <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1687950/Persona_5_Royal/\" target=\"_blank\">Steam</a> and <a href=\"https://www.xbox.com/en-us/games/store/persona-5-royal/9nzdhxl9sjj8\" target=\"_blank\">Microsoft Store</a>.<br><br>Looking to mod a different version of <b>P5R</b>?<br><br><ul><li><a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/games/17354\">Persona 5 Royal (Switch)</a></li><li class=\"SelectedElement\"><a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/games/8464\">Persona 5 Royal (PS4)</a></li></ul><br><hr><br><h2><b><span class=\"GreenColor\">First time here?</span></b><br></h2>Before you download&nbsp;<b><u>anything</u></b>, check out the following to get set up!<br><br><ul><li><a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/tuts/15399\">\"Beginner's Guide to Modding P5R\"</a><br></li><li><a href=\"https://sewer56.dev/p5rpc.modloader/\" target=\"_blank\">\"P5R PC Essentials Documentation\"</a></li></ul><br>If you'd like to chat with the community, check out the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/naoto\" target=\"_blank\">Persona Modding Discord server</a>.<br><br><hr><br><h2><span class=\"GreenColor\">News</span></h2><ul><li>24 Oct 22 - <a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/news/21765\">Modding Status</a></li></ul>",
